          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, John, have heard and seen all these things. And when I finished hearing and seeing them, I fell down at the feet of the angel who had shown me these things, and I was about to worship him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he said to me, “Don't do it! I am a servant together with you and with your brothers the prophets and with all those who obey the words in this book. Worship God!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said to me, “Do not keep the prophetic words of this book a secret, because the time is near when all this will happen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 12.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever is evil must go on doing evil, and whoever is filthy must go on being filthy; whoever is good must go on doing good, and whoever is holy must go on being holy.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
